// Every font family referenced by a built-in Style is bundled here (via
// @fontsource) so the app renders all built-ins beautifully OFFLINE. A user who
// picks a *custom* family the built-ins don't use gets it on demand instead —
// fetched + cached by the main process (see src/main/fonts.js, ensureFontLoaded).
//
// Keep this list in lock-step with the `BUNDLED` set in fonts.js and the fonts
// referenced in styles.js. Weights imported are those each family actually ships
// among {400,500,600,700}; display/handwriting faces that only ship 400 get 400.

